WEBVTT

01:31.000 --> 01:33.920
[Episode 17]

01:58.239 --> 01:59.739
He Du.

02:08.000 --> 02:10.099
We agreed on this time.

02:11.000 --> 02:12.939
Why hasn't he come yet?

02:34.159 --> 02:36.992
You trespassed here and disturbed me.

02:36.992 --> 02:38.719
Do you know the penalty?

02:38.719 --> 02:41.920
Your Majesty, Lord Xu has sent me

02:41.920 --> 02:43.479
to present tea.

02:43.479 --> 02:46.144
And I carried this tea here with great care,

02:46.144 --> 02:48.400
only hoping you'd taste it.

02:48.400 --> 02:50.560
But when I saw you,

02:50.560 --> 02:53.599
I lost my composure
and slipped into the water.

02:53.599 --> 02:55.280
I meant no offense.

02:55.280 --> 02:56.780
Your Majesty,

02:59.080 --> 03:02.039
I'm not a frivolous woman.

03:02.039 --> 03:04.280
It is just...

03:04.280 --> 03:05.919
It is just that I have long admired you.

03:05.919 --> 03:07.479
What have you applied on your body?

03:07.479 --> 03:09.419
Was it also arranged by Lord Xu?

03:10.520 --> 03:14.159
Entering the palace to serve Your Majesty
has always been my wish.

03:14.159 --> 03:17.360
Lord Xu found out my deep affection
for Your Majesty

03:17.360 --> 03:19.360
- and intended to help bring this about.
- Preposterous!

03:19.360 --> 03:22.319
I beg Your Majesty
to take pity on my sincerity

03:22.319 --> 03:24.319
and allow me to enter the palace.

03:24.319 --> 03:26.819
I will spare your life for today.

03:27.800 --> 03:29.300
Now get lost!

03:32.520 --> 03:33.960
Your Majesty,

03:33.960 --> 03:37.240
my coming here tonight
is already a grave transgression.

03:37.240 --> 03:40.439
If I am cast out now
in such disheveled attire,

03:40.439 --> 03:42.280
rumors will surely spread.

03:42.280 --> 03:45.639
My reputation will be ruined,
and I won't survive it.

03:45.639 --> 03:47.199
When you stooped to this scheme,

03:47.199 --> 03:50.080
you should have anticipated this outcome.

03:50.080 --> 03:51.319
Get lost!

03:51.319 --> 03:53.620
Then I can only atone with my death.

03:55.439 --> 03:58.479
Don't die in my sight.

03:58.479 --> 03:59.560
Chief Steward You.

03:59.560 --> 04:03.000
Your Majesty!
Your Majesty, you must not do this!

04:03.000 --> 04:06.120
Are you helping Lord Xu scheme against me?

04:06.120 --> 04:07.360
Please calm down, Your Majesty.

04:07.360 --> 04:09.000
Everything I did today was for your good--

04:09.000 --> 04:10.500
Enough!

04:11.879 --> 04:15.080
Your Majesty. Your Majesty.

04:15.080 --> 04:16.580
Your Majesty.

05:25.560 --> 05:27.920
Your Majesty, the rain is growing heavier.

05:27.920 --> 05:29.740
We should return to the palace soon.

05:36.120 --> 05:37.839
How dare you attack a court official!

05:37.839 --> 05:39.399
How dare you!

05:39.399 --> 05:41.319
Your rank means nothing here.

05:41.319 --> 05:43.839
You're in our hands now.
You just do what we say.

05:43.839 --> 05:47.319
I hear that Miss Meng is a woman
His Majesty fancies.

05:47.319 --> 05:50.120
Tonight, we'd like to be His Majesty.

05:50.120 --> 05:53.620
One more step
and I'll take your worthless lives.

05:55.600 --> 05:57.500
You filthy wretch, you dare hit me?

06:00.160 --> 06:01.839
- Feisty!
- Let go of me!

06:01.839 --> 06:03.720
Let's see how long you can struggle.

06:03.720 --> 06:05.220
Let go of me!

06:07.199 --> 06:08.720
Let go of me!

06:08.720 --> 06:10.220
Let go!

06:13.120 --> 06:14.720
Come on, Miss Meng.

06:14.720 --> 06:16.220
Miss Meng.

06:41.600 --> 06:44.160
I like a feisty woman like you.

06:44.160 --> 06:46.079
They say you always care for the people.

06:46.079 --> 06:47.729
- Let go of me!
- Today,

06:47.729 --> 06:50.899
just care for us brothers well.

06:52.319 --> 06:54.339
Alright. Come on.

07:06.079 --> 07:08.579
Brother, are you alright?

07:13.839 --> 07:16.339
Stop! Hold her down!

07:20.240 --> 07:21.920
Run, Miss Meng.

07:21.920 --> 07:24.060
Let's see where you can go.

07:48.639 --> 07:51.220
S-Sorcery!

08:14.560 --> 08:16.060
Miss Meng!

08:22.279 --> 08:24.860
Miss Meng, what happened?

08:29.959 --> 08:31.459
Yin Qing.

08:39.679 --> 08:41.712
Forget it.

08:41.712 --> 08:43.519
Return to the palace.

08:43.519 --> 08:45.019
Your Majesty!

08:46.840 --> 08:48.340
Your Majesty!

08:49.519 --> 08:51.000
Your Majesty, something has happened.

08:51.000 --> 08:54.860
Miss Meng was attacked by villains
on her way back to the Censorate.

09:07.120 --> 09:08.600
Your Majesty,

09:08.600 --> 09:11.820
Zhi Li says Miss Meng refuses to see anyone.

09:13.679 --> 09:15.519
Captain Di,

09:15.519 --> 09:18.279
leave no stone unturned

09:18.279 --> 09:21.179
and find those villains for me.

09:36.928 --> 09:38.280
[Yan Residence]

09:40.080 --> 09:41.580
My lady.

09:42.799 --> 09:45.879
My lady, you've been up for days
taking care of the master.

09:45.879 --> 09:47.000
You're already exhausted.

09:47.000 --> 09:49.440
Let me handle
the brewing of medicine and tea.

09:49.440 --> 09:50.519
Xi Er,

09:50.519 --> 09:52.559
Father has been out of it for days.

09:52.559 --> 09:54.200
He can't even take his medicine.

09:54.200 --> 09:56.080
I got a prescription from a top physician.

09:56.080 --> 09:59.120
I need to make sure he takes it today.

09:59.120 --> 10:00.700
My lady.

10:02.240 --> 10:03.919
Miss Yan,

10:03.919 --> 10:05.240
congratulations!

10:05.240 --> 10:07.980
This is a match made in heaven.

10:09.240 --> 10:10.740
Xi Er.

10:14.080 --> 10:16.279
What is this?

10:16.279 --> 10:17.960
Master Yan.

10:17.960 --> 10:19.440
Master,

10:19.440 --> 10:21.799
- the Song family's betrothal gifts have arrived.
- They are all here.

10:21.799 --> 10:23.360
I've been bedridden for over half a month,

10:23.360 --> 10:26.440
but seeing the betrothal gifts
makes me feel much better.

10:26.440 --> 10:27.720
The master was right.

10:27.720 --> 10:29.919
The betrothal did bring good fortune.

10:29.919 --> 10:33.039
Father, do you know how worried
I've been about you?

10:33.039 --> 10:35.559
I left my business in the capital
and rushed back.

10:35.559 --> 10:37.720
You faked being ill
to get me back and marry me off?

10:37.720 --> 10:39.840
Would you have come back if I hadn't?

10:39.840 --> 10:42.120
Isn't Bofeng House in Shazhou enough
for you to run?

10:42.120 --> 10:44.039
Must you follow Meng Ting Hui to the capital?

10:44.039 --> 10:46.080
I went to the capital
not just to accompany Meng.

10:46.080 --> 10:47.399
I also have my own ambitions.

10:47.399 --> 10:48.759
What ambitions could you have?

10:48.759 --> 10:52.200
Word of Meng Ting Hui's killing on the street
has already reached Shazhou.

10:52.200 --> 10:55.559
Keep following her and you'll stay unwed.

10:55.559 --> 10:58.159
Master, calm down.

10:58.159 --> 11:02.240
I heard that Bofeng House in the capital
is using Meng Ting Hui's name,

11:02.240 --> 11:04.080
and its business is booming.

11:04.080 --> 11:07.200
Although Fu Zhi deals with men all day,

11:07.200 --> 11:09.799
she really has a knack for business.

11:09.799 --> 11:12.120
No matter how high Meng Ting Hui rises,

11:12.120 --> 11:14.200
our family has no use for her.

11:14.200 --> 11:18.039
And since when does our daughter
need to appear in public?

11:18.039 --> 11:20.039
It's a pure disgrace!

11:20.039 --> 11:21.559
Father!

11:21.559 --> 11:24.320
When I was little,
you taught me how to read the account books,

11:24.320 --> 11:26.320
and you told me I was cut out for business.

11:26.320 --> 11:28.960
Now I manage Bofeng House in perfect order,

11:28.960 --> 11:30.159
and I've expanded the business.

11:30.159 --> 11:32.080
What have I done wrong?

11:32.080 --> 11:33.679
I don't expect you to praise me,

11:33.679 --> 11:36.220
but you cannot look down on me.

11:38.159 --> 11:39.159
Fu Zhi.

11:39.159 --> 11:42.000
What are you up to now?

11:42.000 --> 11:43.759
Fu Zhi,

11:43.759 --> 11:45.759
your father only wants what's best for you.

11:45.759 --> 11:48.519
Look, we've accepted the betrothal gifts.

11:48.519 --> 11:50.720
Don't make things difficult for your father.

11:50.720 --> 11:53.360
The Song family is well-known to us
and well-off.

11:53.360 --> 11:55.600
And they've been sincere over the years.

11:55.600 --> 11:56.679
If you marry into their family,

11:56.679 --> 11:59.159
our family businesses can merge into one.

11:59.159 --> 12:02.960
It's far better than you struggling alone
in the capital.

12:02.960 --> 12:06.519
I think the Song family must be
protecting their own interests

12:06.519 --> 12:08.200
by paying you under the table.

12:08.200 --> 12:10.440
So you urged Father to marry me off to them.

12:10.440 --> 12:12.320
I was wronged.

12:12.320 --> 12:15.440
Father, she's scheming so hard
to marry me off

12:15.440 --> 12:17.320
only to monopolize our family's assets

12:17.320 --> 12:20.360
and leave all these dowries to her son.

12:20.360 --> 12:21.480
What about you?

12:21.480 --> 12:24.759
Have you ever once truly thought about me?

12:24.759 --> 12:26.679
If my mother were still alive,

12:26.679 --> 12:29.019
she would never force me like this.

12:31.279 --> 12:32.279
Fu Zhi.

12:32.279 --> 12:33.600
- Father!
- Honey.

12:33.600 --> 12:35.120
I've put in so much effort

12:35.120 --> 12:37.360
just hoping Fu Zhi could settle down soon,

12:37.360 --> 12:39.080
so you could enjoy familial bliss.

12:39.080 --> 12:41.759
I never imagined
Fu Zhi would think of me this way.

12:41.759 --> 12:43.080
All these years,

12:43.080 --> 12:45.960
I have toiled and labored
to manage this household,

12:45.960 --> 12:48.679
only to earn such complaints?

12:48.679 --> 12:49.679
Forget it.

12:49.679 --> 12:51.759
- Father!
- Let's just cancel the betrothal!

12:51.759 --> 12:53.799
Then go and cancel it!

12:53.799 --> 12:56.960
I said I won't marry, and I meant it.

12:56.960 --> 12:58.919
Stop her quickly!

12:58.919 --> 13:01.879
Send Fu Zhi back to her room.
You stand guard outside.

13:01.879 --> 13:04.720
She doesn't leave her room without my order.

13:04.720 --> 13:06.639
How long do you plan to keep me locked up?

13:06.639 --> 13:09.399
Until you are married off.

13:09.399 --> 13:13.799
Should we reconsider this marriage?

13:13.799 --> 13:17.000
If Fu Zhi is unwilling, just let it be.

13:17.000 --> 13:18.600
Delays add risk.

13:18.600 --> 13:21.200
Follow the date chosen by the Song family.
The sooner, the better.

13:21.200 --> 13:23.299
In three days is an auspicious date.

13:24.840 --> 13:27.240
Fine. The wedding will be in three days.

13:27.240 --> 13:30.840
Let's see who will help you
without Meng Ting Hui around.

13:30.840 --> 13:32.679
Lock her up!

13:32.679 --> 13:34.179
Let go of me!

13:43.519 --> 13:46.019
Master, what brings you here?

13:47.240 --> 13:50.720
I figured you'd be terrified
by what happened to Meng Ting Hui.

13:50.720 --> 13:52.960
I heard you haven't been home for days,

13:52.960 --> 13:55.240
digging through files at the Censorate

13:55.240 --> 13:56.759
to track down the criminals.

13:56.759 --> 13:58.600
I truly cannot believe

13:58.600 --> 14:00.399
that a good person like Miss Meng

14:00.399 --> 14:02.639
would encounter such a thing.

14:02.639 --> 14:04.840
I despise those evildoers to the core.

14:04.840 --> 14:08.559
I wish I could strike them dead
with lightning.

14:08.559 --> 14:12.700
People like them deserve to die
without heirs and peace.

14:16.368 --> 14:19.000
When did you start sounding
as harsh as Meng Ting Hui?

14:19.000 --> 14:21.360
I am merely speaking
what everyone is thinking.

14:21.360 --> 14:25.360
They used such vile tactics
against a helpless woman.

14:25.360 --> 14:26.720
How despicable!

14:26.720 --> 14:30.679
Now, Miss Meng has locked herself
in her room,

14:30.679 --> 14:32.679
refusing to see anyone.

14:32.679 --> 14:35.220
I am truly worried she might hurt herself.

14:47.320 --> 14:49.139
Thank goodness you are alright.

15:29.080 --> 15:32.519
Le Yan, I wish to discuss something with you.

15:32.519 --> 15:35.360
Lord Xu has always been very critical
of Meng Ting Hui.

15:35.360 --> 15:37.120
Now that her reputation is damaged,

15:37.120 --> 15:41.159
he'll exploit this to make trouble
and go after the Censorate.

15:41.159 --> 15:44.600
If Meng Ting Hui can't continue to lead it,

15:44.600 --> 15:46.360
I have an idea.

15:46.360 --> 15:50.840
I'll recommend you to His Majesty
to take her place.

15:50.840 --> 15:54.980
You mean you want me to replace Miss Meng?

15:56.919 --> 15:58.240
No.

15:58.240 --> 16:02.840
Master, do you know
how Miss Meng is suffering right now?

16:02.840 --> 16:06.580
Just thinking about it wrenches my heart.

16:08.519 --> 16:12.360
I cannot have such a thought
at her most difficult moment.

16:12.360 --> 16:14.200
Silly child,

16:14.200 --> 16:16.440
do you think I don't feel sorry for her too?

16:16.440 --> 16:18.080
But I have always believed

16:18.080 --> 16:21.440
that the Censorate needs
a woman of both virtue and talent like you

16:21.440 --> 16:22.879
to uphold integrity.

16:22.879 --> 16:25.720
You are more suited
than Meng Ting Hui to lead it.

16:25.720 --> 16:27.519
Now that she's in trouble,

16:27.519 --> 16:30.399
you're left to bear everything alone,
and it pains me to see it.

16:30.399 --> 16:32.080
I want to lend you a hand

16:32.080 --> 16:35.399
to protect the Censorate you and His Majesty
have poured yourselves into.

16:35.399 --> 16:38.080
When Miss Meng was holding up the Censorate,

16:38.080 --> 16:40.960
many doubted if a woman
could rise to such a challenge.

16:40.960 --> 16:42.960
Now that she's in a dire position,

16:42.960 --> 16:44.759
you want me to seize her power?

16:44.759 --> 16:46.039
What kind of protection is that?

16:46.039 --> 16:48.200
You've always known best.

16:48.200 --> 16:50.879
How is it that today
you don't see my intentions?

16:50.879 --> 16:54.200
It'll be best
if Lord Xu does not exploit this.

16:54.200 --> 16:56.100
But what if that day truly comes?

17:15.160 --> 17:19.900
The Censorate only has meaning
with Miss Meng leading it.

17:20.759 --> 17:22.400
If you truly wish to help me,

17:22.400 --> 17:26.339
then no matter what Lord Xu does,
you will help me.

17:28.000 --> 17:30.500
I'll stand with Miss Meng
through thick and thin.

17:31.680 --> 17:35.180
I don't want that official post.

17:58.160 --> 18:02.700
I'm incompetent and failed to protect you.

18:14.360 --> 18:17.240
[Censorate]

19:11.640 --> 19:13.140
Your Majesty,

19:14.200 --> 19:16.579
could you show me how to protect myself?

20:17.480 --> 20:19.680
[Yan Residence]

20:19.680 --> 20:22.019
- Please come in.
- Please come in.

20:28.519 --> 20:30.119
- Congratulations!
- Thank you!

20:30.119 --> 20:31.619
Please come in.

20:47.119 --> 20:49.160
Here, groom.

20:49.160 --> 20:50.640
Here, bride.

20:50.640 --> 20:53.559
Please don't make this hard.
I'm just paid to do my job.

20:53.559 --> 20:55.480
Father-in-law, Mother-in-law,

20:55.480 --> 20:57.200
I'll take Fu Zhi to my residence now.

20:57.200 --> 20:59.079
Alright.

20:59.079 --> 21:00.579
Let's go, Fu Zhi.

21:05.680 --> 21:07.180
Let go of me!

21:08.720 --> 21:09.720
You two!

21:09.720 --> 21:11.279
One fakes illness to sell your daughter,

21:11.279 --> 21:13.000
and the other is two-faced.

21:13.000 --> 21:15.279
You are working together
to push me into a pit of fire.

21:15.279 --> 21:17.519
Fu Zhi, all our relatives and friends
are here.

21:17.519 --> 21:18.839
How can you say such things?

21:18.839 --> 21:20.200
- Fu Zhi--
- And you!

21:20.200 --> 21:23.960
I should have killed you
at Bofeng House that day,

21:23.960 --> 21:26.519
saving myself from the disgust
you bring me today.

21:26.519 --> 21:28.039
I'm the Song family's rightful heir.

21:28.039 --> 21:30.079
What's the problem with marrying me?

21:30.079 --> 21:32.099
How dare you be so ungrateful!

21:33.640 --> 21:35.359
- Hurry, stop her!
- Let go of me!

21:35.359 --> 21:36.859
Hurry!

21:39.319 --> 21:40.920
Why are you so disobedient?

21:40.920 --> 21:43.519
Fu Zhi, today is our wedding day.

21:43.519 --> 21:45.759
Don't think of running away.

21:45.759 --> 21:48.500
Father! Father!

21:49.799 --> 21:50.960
My apologies for the spectacle.

21:50.960 --> 21:52.920
Let go of me!

21:52.920 --> 21:55.079
Father-in-law, Mother-in-law,

21:55.079 --> 21:56.592
I'll take Fu Zhi to my residence now.

21:56.592 --> 21:57.599
Go ahead. Hurry.

21:57.599 --> 21:59.119
- Let's go.
- Hurry.

21:59.119 --> 22:00.119
Father!

22:00.119 --> 22:01.619
Stop!

22:23.480 --> 22:26.619
Let's see who dares
to lay a finger on her today!

22:31.480 --> 22:34.099
Fu Zhi, sorry I am late.

22:39.880 --> 22:43.440
Governor Wang,
today is my daughter's wedding day.

22:43.440 --> 22:45.119
What are you doing here?

22:45.119 --> 22:46.839
What exactly has your family done

22:46.839 --> 22:48.720
to offend Mr. Shen?

22:48.720 --> 22:50.880
He is the son of the current Grand Tutor,

22:50.880 --> 22:53.039
the renowned Envoy of Customs
from the capital,

22:53.039 --> 22:55.720
and a highly favored person
by His Majesty's side.

22:55.720 --> 22:58.279
I-I don't know.

22:58.279 --> 22:59.519
You don't know?

22:59.519 --> 23:01.319
Then let me ask you, Master Yan.

23:01.319 --> 23:04.480
What is the crime
for forcing my betrothed wife

23:04.480 --> 23:06.319
to marry another man?

23:06.319 --> 23:09.740
Mr. Shen, where is this coming from?

23:11.720 --> 23:14.680
So it's Mr. Shen's family matter.

23:14.680 --> 23:16.599
- Guards!
- Here!

23:16.599 --> 23:18.960
Clear out all these irrelevant people.

23:18.960 --> 23:20.460
Yes!

23:21.720 --> 23:22.720
Move quickly!

23:22.720 --> 23:24.319
Move!

23:24.319 --> 23:27.579
Mr. Song, please leave.

23:29.480 --> 23:30.980
I take my leave.

23:35.759 --> 23:37.200
Mr. Shen,

23:37.200 --> 23:40.240
there's no betrothal between our families.

23:40.240 --> 23:42.720
Master Yan, Fu Zhi and I are of one heart

23:42.720 --> 23:44.799
and have chosen each other.

23:44.799 --> 23:46.519
We've already consummated our bond.

23:46.519 --> 23:48.539
Consummated your bond?

23:49.880 --> 23:51.160
This is my fault.

23:51.160 --> 23:52.799
I was a bit of a libertine before,

23:52.799 --> 23:54.240
so Fu Zhi always had reservations.

23:54.240 --> 23:55.240
But I swear,

23:55.240 --> 23:58.299
after meeting Fu Zhi,
there is no one else in my heart.

24:01.279 --> 24:03.192
I wanted to pick an auspicious day

24:03.192 --> 24:05.319
to come to propose personally
with betrothal gifts.

24:05.319 --> 24:08.559
But I never expected Fu Zhi
to suddenly return to Shazhou.

24:08.559 --> 24:10.480
If I hadn't come today,

24:10.480 --> 24:13.500
Fu Zhi would probably
become the Song family's bride by now.

24:15.359 --> 24:16.599
Mr. Shen,

24:16.599 --> 24:19.559
had I known you and Fu Zhi were of one heart,

24:19.559 --> 24:21.599
there'd be no place for the Song family.

24:21.599 --> 24:23.839
Tomorrow, I will talk to the Song family.

24:23.839 --> 24:25.680
- Tomorrow?
- No.

24:25.680 --> 24:28.359
I will go immediately
to cancel the betrothal with the Songs

24:28.359 --> 24:31.039
and return the betrothal gifts. At once!

24:31.039 --> 24:33.880
Then please rise quickly, Father-in-law.

24:33.880 --> 24:36.119
Thank you.

24:36.119 --> 24:37.680
Mr. Shen,

24:37.680 --> 24:41.000
our Yan family is merely
a merchant family after all.

24:41.000 --> 24:44.119
Fu Zhi has little learning
and a stubborn temperament,

24:44.119 --> 24:47.680
and she is not your match
in terms of family, looks, and learning.

24:47.680 --> 24:49.519
You say you like Fu Zhi?

24:49.519 --> 24:51.279
- Surely you're not joking with us?
- Indeed.

24:51.279 --> 24:54.000
Mrs. Yan, are you belittling Fu Zhi,

24:54.000 --> 24:56.359
or are you questioning my sincerity?

24:56.359 --> 24:58.319
Fu Zhi is unique in my heart.

24:58.319 --> 25:00.920
None of family status, appearance, or talent

25:00.920 --> 25:02.680
weighs heavier than herself alone.

25:02.680 --> 25:06.279
My feelings for Fu Zhi are genuine and true,

25:06.279 --> 25:07.480
and I mean every word.

25:07.480 --> 25:08.799
In that case,

25:08.799 --> 25:12.128
why don't you and Fu Zhi
perform the wedding ceremony tonight?

25:12.128 --> 25:13.152
- No.
- Alright.

25:13.152 --> 25:14.880
Mrs. Yan, with this arrangement,

25:14.880 --> 25:17.200
are you hoping
I'll marry into your family instead?

25:17.200 --> 25:18.359
We wouldn't dare.

25:18.359 --> 25:20.720
I'm just afraid that you're acting
on a momentary whim

25:20.720 --> 25:22.640
and might delay Fu Zhi's prospects.

25:22.640 --> 25:24.200
If I am to marry Fu Zhi,

25:24.200 --> 25:25.720
the Six Rites must be complete,

25:25.720 --> 25:27.759
and the Three Letters shall be in full.

25:27.759 --> 25:29.480
At a blessed hour on an auspicious day,

25:29.480 --> 25:31.799
I shall arrive with a great procession

25:31.799 --> 25:34.400
and have Fu Zhi marry into our Shen family
in full ceremony.

25:34.400 --> 25:36.480
Being able to receive your great affection

25:36.480 --> 25:38.200
is great fortune for Fu Zhi.

25:38.200 --> 25:39.599
My wife is ignorant.

25:39.599 --> 25:42.579
Please forgive her, Mr. Shen.

25:43.680 --> 25:45.200
You ignorant woman,

25:45.200 --> 25:47.460
hurry and apologize to Mr. Shen.

25:49.759 --> 25:52.680
I was presumptuous.

25:52.680 --> 25:53.799
It's getting late.

25:53.799 --> 25:56.480
I'll have the servants
prepare a guest room at once

25:56.480 --> 25:58.599
so you can rest early, Mr. Shen.

25:58.599 --> 26:00.039
Master,

26:00.039 --> 26:03.559
since Mr. Shen and Fu Zhi
have consummated their bond,

26:03.559 --> 26:05.759
what harm is there in sharing the same bed?

26:05.759 --> 26:06.880
Mrs. Yan, I--

26:06.880 --> 26:08.160
You've been apart for days.

26:08.160 --> 26:10.799
You surely need a good reunion.

26:10.799 --> 26:12.299
Xi Er,

26:13.200 --> 26:16.099
quickly escort Fu Zhi and Mr. Shen
back to the room.

26:16.960 --> 26:18.779
Go quickly.

26:23.759 --> 26:25.520
Honey,

26:25.520 --> 26:27.099
this is too...

26:35.840 --> 26:37.600
[Censorate]

26:41.480 --> 26:43.119
Miss Meng,

26:43.119 --> 26:44.960
His Majesty has granted you a carriage.

26:44.960 --> 26:47.279
You may ride in the carriage
to court or the palace.

26:47.279 --> 26:48.779
Please, Miss Meng.

26:51.519 --> 26:53.240
Please tell His Majesty

26:53.240 --> 26:56.000
that I'm grateful for his kindness.

26:56.000 --> 26:59.119
I haven't set foot in the marketplace
for a long time.

26:59.119 --> 27:00.480
So I feel like walking today

27:00.480 --> 27:02.460
and buying some daily necessities.

27:03.319 --> 27:05.440
Miss Meng,

27:05.440 --> 27:07.079
it's an imperial order.

27:07.079 --> 27:09.240
Rumors are like the wind.

27:09.240 --> 27:11.880
If I allowed that to make me waver,

27:11.880 --> 27:15.160
wouldn't that be exactly
what the rumormongers wanted?

27:15.160 --> 27:17.799
I act with integrity and sit upright,

27:17.799 --> 27:20.279
and I walk where I dare to be seen.

27:20.279 --> 27:23.319
Imperial Guard Huang,
tell His Majesty what I said.

27:23.319 --> 27:24.859
He will not blame you.

27:42.960 --> 27:45.519
This rain never ends.
There isn't a single guest.

27:45.519 --> 27:48.019
Soon we'll be queuing up to starve.

27:49.559 --> 27:51.319
Isn't that Miss Meng?

27:51.319 --> 27:54.119
After all that,
she still goes out all dressed up?

27:54.119 --> 27:57.240
Isn't she afraid
that people might call her improper?

27:57.240 --> 27:59.400
My lady, I have to say,

27:59.400 --> 28:01.279
Miss Meng does have some good looks.

28:01.279 --> 28:03.519
You are pathetic.

28:03.519 --> 28:07.759
An evil woman
naturally has her seductive tricks.

28:07.759 --> 28:09.240
Have you heard about that night?

28:09.240 --> 28:10.559
Someone saw it personally

28:10.559 --> 28:12.680
that she lured those two thugs
with her beauty

28:12.680 --> 28:14.720
and then drew the lightning to one of them.

28:14.720 --> 28:16.480
Then with a bang,

28:16.480 --> 28:19.059
that thug was struck dead by lightning.

28:20.920 --> 28:23.640
Then she doesn't really know
some sorcery, does she?

28:23.640 --> 28:24.839
Who knows?

28:24.839 --> 28:26.759
About this endless rain we've been having,

28:26.759 --> 28:28.599
they're all saying she conjured it.

28:28.599 --> 28:31.779
They say she enchants all,
and she's an omen of ruin.

28:32.799 --> 28:36.039
Good day, Miss Meng.

28:36.039 --> 28:37.400
Stop staring. Stay away.

28:37.400 --> 28:40.079
If you court disaster,
don't say I didn't warn you.

28:40.079 --> 28:41.880
Let's go.

28:41.880 --> 28:43.839
This rain is truly endless.

28:43.839 --> 28:46.440
Going out now is such a nuisance.

28:46.440 --> 28:49.119
My skirt's hem is all soaked.

28:49.119 --> 28:51.440
The day after tomorrow is my birthday.

28:51.440 --> 28:53.259
What bad luck this is.

28:54.200 --> 28:56.160
Ruo Mei, please bear with it.

28:56.160 --> 29:00.359
The rouge from Jinfen Shop
is among the best in the capital.

29:00.359 --> 29:02.980
You'll need it at your birthday banquet.

29:03.960 --> 29:05.680
Isn't that Meng Ting Hui?

29:05.680 --> 29:07.319
What is she doing out here?

29:07.319 --> 29:09.000
She sure isn't afraid of the rain.

29:09.000 --> 29:11.759
Well, what else does she have
to care about now?

29:11.759 --> 29:14.279
Her attire alone
shows her intention to entice.

29:14.279 --> 29:17.640
Already infamous,
and she still flaunts herself.

29:17.640 --> 29:20.720
Some people probably think
that by using this rouge,

29:20.720 --> 29:22.960
they can climb up and change their fate.

29:22.960 --> 29:26.240
In terms of beauty,
she isn't even a fraction of Ruo Mei's.

29:26.240 --> 29:27.920
So what if a woman is an official?

29:27.920 --> 29:29.839
Marrying well is what really matters.

29:29.839 --> 29:31.339
Exactly.

29:38.880 --> 29:41.640
Shopkeeper, this rouge is excellent.

29:41.640 --> 29:43.779
I'll take the entire batch.

29:45.119 --> 29:47.079
Ladies, you are of noble status,

29:47.079 --> 29:48.880
yet you sound so harsh.

29:48.880 --> 29:50.200
Have you no concern for your status?

29:50.200 --> 29:53.319
The crime lies with the perpetrators,
not with the victim.

29:53.319 --> 29:55.960
Let's see who dares to take pleasure
in the pain of others,

29:55.960 --> 29:58.839
twisting right and wrong
and spreading rumors.

29:58.839 --> 30:00.339
Well said.

30:01.920 --> 30:05.119
Those who judge by one's rouge
and moralize by one's attire

30:05.119 --> 30:06.480
are truly shallow.

30:06.480 --> 30:08.119
Those who judge worth by birth

30:08.119 --> 30:09.640
and success by marriage

30:09.640 --> 30:11.819
are no better than frogs in a well.

30:13.039 --> 30:14.880
A summer insect knows no ice.

30:14.880 --> 30:16.980
No need to waste words on them.

30:20.519 --> 30:23.319
I don't want to use the same as them.

30:23.319 --> 30:24.819
I'm not buying it.

30:28.559 --> 30:30.519
Zhi Li,

30:30.519 --> 30:32.279
Miss Situ,

30:32.279 --> 30:34.559
thank you both for your help today.

30:34.559 --> 30:35.759
Miss Meng, you're too polite.

30:35.759 --> 30:37.400
It was merely a small effort.

30:37.400 --> 30:39.839
I think the rain won't stop anytime soon.

30:39.839 --> 30:41.519
My Huiyin House is nearby.

30:41.519 --> 30:43.039
It has sound therapy inside.

30:43.039 --> 30:45.759
I wonder if you two would honor me
by giving it a try.

30:45.759 --> 30:48.960
I have long heard of it. It'd be my honor.

30:48.960 --> 30:53.160
I heard my brother mention it before.
I must go and see it.

30:53.160 --> 30:54.660
Please.

31:15.200 --> 31:16.700
- You--
- You speak--

31:19.296 --> 31:20.359
You speak--

31:20.359 --> 31:22.640
You go first.

31:22.640 --> 31:23.680
Still nervous?

31:23.680 --> 31:25.420
What am I nervous about?

31:26.720 --> 31:28.299
Then your hand...

31:32.352 --> 31:35.480
This weather feels like a tear in the sky,

31:35.480 --> 31:37.872
with rain pouring down endlessly.

31:37.872 --> 31:40.759
Now the entire Ning Empire
is troubled by the rain.

31:40.759 --> 31:43.376
If it keeps raining like this,

31:43.376 --> 31:45.559
life for the people
will become very difficult.

31:45.559 --> 31:47.059
So

31:47.920 --> 31:49.859
why did you come to Shazhou?

31:52.000 --> 31:53.480
I'm on His Majesty's business.

31:53.480 --> 31:55.759
I had some time today,
so I stopped by Bofeng House.

31:55.759 --> 31:58.640
I saw Hai Tang getting stopped by some men
while delivering a letter.

31:58.640 --> 32:00.259
After I stepped in to help,

32:01.559 --> 32:04.759
I learned about your situation from her.

32:04.759 --> 32:06.960
I had written a secret letter

32:06.960 --> 32:09.680
and wanted Hai Tang to get help for me.

32:09.680 --> 32:13.740
She must have been targeted
by my stepmother's people.

32:15.160 --> 32:18.140
Thank you for your help today. Otherwise...

32:18.920 --> 32:20.480
You're usually so bold and free,

32:20.480 --> 32:21.720
even a bit overbearing.

32:21.720 --> 32:24.259
I never imagined
you grew up in such a family.

32:27.079 --> 32:31.119
I simply have a stubborn and snobbish father,

32:31.119 --> 32:33.559
a stepmother who looks like a saint

32:33.559 --> 32:35.039
but is quite despicable,

32:35.039 --> 32:36.839
and a mischievous stepbrother.

32:36.839 --> 32:38.420
I've long gotten used to it.

32:39.599 --> 32:41.099
Does it still hurt?

32:42.200 --> 32:43.700
It doesn't.

33:07.200 --> 33:08.700
I'll be gentler.

33:11.640 --> 33:14.680
You are a noble lady
from a prominent family in Shazhou.

33:14.680 --> 33:18.000
For other girls,
getting married would be a good option.

33:18.000 --> 33:19.680
Why do you resist it so much?

33:19.680 --> 33:21.039
What do you know?

33:21.039 --> 33:24.119
I went to the capital to accompany Meng,

33:24.119 --> 33:26.119
and also for my own ambitions.

33:26.119 --> 33:27.859
I like doing business.

33:30.640 --> 33:32.039
Everyone says

33:32.039 --> 33:34.640
that a woman is meant
for caring for her husband and children.

33:34.640 --> 33:36.000
I refuse.

33:36.000 --> 33:38.680
I will open Bofeng House
all across the Ning Empire.

33:38.680 --> 33:41.039
I want to carve out a world of my own.

33:41.039 --> 33:43.960
Besides, even if I were to marry,

33:43.960 --> 33:45.670
I would find someone

33:45.670 --> 33:48.359
who loves me and shares the same heart.

33:48.359 --> 33:50.240
So we can earn money together,

33:50.240 --> 33:51.936
travel the realm together,

33:51.936 --> 33:53.859
and share a simple, warm life.

33:56.640 --> 33:58.140
So

33:59.559 --> 34:01.619
I have never truly understood you.

34:05.559 --> 34:06.720
I'm so sleepy.

34:06.720 --> 34:08.119
Locked up by my father for three days,

34:08.119 --> 34:09.800
I can finally get a good night's sleep.

34:09.800 --> 34:11.960
Well...

34:11.960 --> 34:14.280
There's only one bed here. W-We...

34:14.280 --> 34:15.440
I almost forgot.

34:15.440 --> 34:17.239
You are delicate and noble.

34:17.239 --> 34:18.920
You sleep on the bed tonight.

34:18.920 --> 34:19.960
I'll sleep on the floor.

34:19.960 --> 34:21.599
I am a man of stature.

34:21.599 --> 34:23.960
How could I let you sleep on the ground?

34:23.960 --> 34:25.280
You sleep on the bed. I...

34:25.280 --> 34:27.639
Fu Zhi, are you asleep?

34:27.639 --> 34:29.139
I'll open the door.

35:04.039 --> 35:05.360
Why did you hit me?

35:05.360 --> 35:06.480
Didn't you make me play along with you?

35:06.480 --> 35:08.320
I wanted you to play along,
not to get into character.

35:08.320 --> 35:09.519
I-I got into character?

35:09.519 --> 35:11.019
You closed your eyes.

35:12.400 --> 35:13.800
I was helping you out.

35:13.800 --> 35:16.440
And you...
Don't get any improper ideas about me.

35:16.440 --> 35:18.599
Me? You're overthinking it.

35:18.599 --> 35:20.719
I was afraid my stepmother would find out.

35:20.719 --> 35:22.659
And you used me as a shield again.

35:23.599 --> 35:25.079
I was just panicking.

35:25.079 --> 35:26.579
Sorry for the offense.

35:33.119 --> 35:34.980
Was it your first kiss?

35:38.519 --> 35:40.039
How could that be?

35:40.039 --> 35:42.119
Go ask around the capital.

35:42.119 --> 35:45.239
When have I ever
lacked beautiful confidantes?

35:45.239 --> 35:48.960
All the girls in the capital
throw themselves at me.

35:48.960 --> 35:52.440
I've always been surrounded by beauties

35:52.440 --> 35:54.619
and tasted every charm they hold.

35:57.280 --> 35:58.599
Then why are you blushing?

35:58.599 --> 35:59.639
I'm not.

35:59.639 --> 36:01.156
I...

36:01.936 --> 36:04.960
T-This room is too hot.

36:04.960 --> 36:06.320
In that case,

36:06.320 --> 36:09.460
I don't have to take responsibility
for that kiss, right?

36:11.159 --> 36:12.599
I don't need you to.

36:12.599 --> 36:13.880
That kiss was so bland.

36:13.880 --> 36:17.400
I'll have forgotten all about it by tomorrow.

36:17.400 --> 36:18.400
That's great.

36:18.400 --> 36:20.840
My stepmother is very suspicious.

36:20.840 --> 36:23.890
So tonight, I might have to trouble you

36:23.890 --> 36:25.639
to share the bed with me.

36:25.639 --> 36:26.960
- I need to--
- Keep your voice down.

36:26.960 --> 36:28.599
You startled me.

36:28.599 --> 36:30.480
Do I need to sacrifice this much?

36:30.480 --> 36:33.420
If you're going to help me,
help me all the way.

36:34.719 --> 36:36.219
I'm tired.

36:58.480 --> 37:00.260
No need to get under the covers.

37:01.760 --> 37:03.260
I...

37:20.480 --> 37:21.980
I am quite tired.

37:30.000 --> 37:31.500
Miss Yan.

38:09.840 --> 38:11.559
It's been pouring in Liangzhou
for seven days.

38:11.559 --> 38:12.760
The city is beginning to flood.

38:12.760 --> 38:14.000
The dam in Qingzhou has burst,

38:14.000 --> 38:15.000
flooding nearby fields.

38:15.000 --> 38:18.000
Jizhou reports
starving people have blocked the main roads.

38:18.000 --> 38:19.400
Issue my decree.

38:19.400 --> 38:21.280
The Ministry of Works
is to make dredging tools now

38:21.280 --> 38:23.079
and dispatch them where they are most needed.

38:23.079 --> 38:24.239
The Ministry of War shall send 30,000 troops

38:24.239 --> 38:25.599
to clear the rivers
and reinforce the river banks

38:25.599 --> 38:26.639
without any delay.

38:26.639 --> 38:30.199
The Ministry of Revenue shall hire refugees
to dredge the rivers, pay them by the day,

38:30.199 --> 38:31.800
and set up porridge kitchens,

38:31.800 --> 38:34.239
so the elderly, women, and children
get two bowls a day.

38:34.239 --> 38:35.719
Yes.

38:35.719 --> 38:37.639
Your Majesty. Your Majesty,

38:37.639 --> 38:39.719
You must take care of your health.

38:39.719 --> 38:43.199
You can't keep going like this
at this hour, in this weather.

38:43.199 --> 38:45.159
Huang Bo, as an Imperial Guard,

38:45.159 --> 38:47.400
you should prioritize His Majesty's health.

38:47.400 --> 38:48.679
- Chief Steward You.
- I--

38:48.679 --> 38:52.880
Look at the rain. Will it pause
for even a moment because I go to sleep?

38:52.880 --> 38:54.592
Will the dam in Qingzhou

38:54.592 --> 38:57.239
burst slower because the hour is late?

38:57.239 --> 38:59.119
- But I--
- Huang Bo,

38:59.119 --> 39:00.159
get it done now.

39:00.159 --> 39:01.659
Yes.

39:04.519 --> 39:09.380
It seems this rain
shows no sign of stopping at all.

39:11.720 --> 39:13.960
[Yan Residence]

39:28.880 --> 39:30.159
What are you doing?

39:30.159 --> 39:33.280
I-I didn't react in time.

39:33.280 --> 39:34.760
Do you know?

39:34.760 --> 39:37.800
I tossed and turned half the night
before I finally fell asleep.

39:37.800 --> 39:40.480
You didn't sleep the whole night?

39:40.480 --> 39:43.619
Mr. Shen, are you awake?

39:45.559 --> 39:47.059
Yes, I am.

39:51.679 --> 39:55.840
I heard quite a commotion
from outside just now.

39:55.840 --> 39:58.159
Even if you love Fu Zhi dearly,

39:58.159 --> 40:00.679
you must take care of your health.

40:00.679 --> 40:03.559
I have specially prepared a nourishing soup.

40:03.559 --> 40:04.559
In here,

40:04.559 --> 40:07.960
- there's ginseng, deer antler, cinnamon--
- He doesn't need this.

40:07.960 --> 40:09.659
Take it back and drink it yourself.

40:10.880 --> 40:13.139
Then drink it later.

40:13.920 --> 40:16.260
I'll be going now.

40:18.320 --> 40:20.719
My lady, an urgent letter from the capital.

40:20.719 --> 40:21.800
It seems to be very important.

40:21.800 --> 40:23.300
The capital?

40:26.960 --> 40:30.280
[Miss Meng in danger]

40:31.880 --> 40:33.460
It's Meng.

40:34.679 --> 40:36.760
Meng is in trouble.

40:36.760 --> 40:37.760
Let's set off immediately

40:37.760 --> 40:39.159
and ride at full speed back to the capital.

40:39.159 --> 40:40.659
Alright.

40:51.568 --> 40:52.639
Your Majesty,

40:52.639 --> 40:54.079
he has already confessed.

40:54.079 --> 40:55.800
He was indeed instigated by the Huxiao Gang.

40:55.800 --> 40:58.659
Your Majesty, spare me!
